# Accidental-commit safeguards only: review files, diffs, and Git history too.
# Keep restricted inputs outside this repository. Ignoring does not untrack files.
# Approved public CSV and EAF files must remain trackable.

# Users supply their own media here. Track only the two language guides.
/movies/*
